{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "4457c6f93122b318be858ec323fb8a81d9c7bc0d56cb19c6092325072175994c", "ja": "特別な時間", "zh": "特别的时光", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "78beb99f72093f14056755dc9aff5deee812f1f3094b1208c2a5df697b080643", "ja": "ツアーの第3弾『EmotionLight』公演が\n始動！　テーマは夕方、ハートとスペードの\nチームから混成メンバーで挑む。スローガン\nは「今、この時間への感謝」！", "zh": "巡演第3弹《EmotionLight》公演\n启动！主题是傍晚，由红桃和黑桃\n队伍的成员混合组队迎接挑战。口号\n是“感谢此刻，这段时光”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3d64f23a7fa72b1ccf15d4787cbab305ff76671eeac3f4c014c9aebe8a8013c9", "ja": "（LOVERS HEARTとSHADE OF SPADEのメンバー\nから、集まれそうな何人かに声を掛けておいた……）", "zh": "（我已经联系了LOVERS HEART和SHADE OF SPADE的成员，邀请了几位能够集合的人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "15df87322a103a5b7a42f5b34fbe93aa6adb797f9b7e68d87ea6187be0861264", "ja": "ふおぉぉーっ、これは、ありさのドルオタ人生でも\n一二を争うほどのお宝ですよぉ！　ムフ、ムフフ♪", "zh": "呜哦哦哦——这可是亚利沙的追星人生中数一数二的宝物哦！　唔呼、唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1002_se", "source_sha256": "7d37269cd3530b9657d1d5a029bdf004162f4d31c7aefdaaf7f0c578d7d3765b", "ja": "パシャッ！　パシャッ！", "zh": "喀嚓！喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "699c4341777367ed3f60298c366b7e14bd2ec44f94c818d49465b0df27ef3276", "ja": "亜利沙さん、何枚撮るんですか？　そろそろ\nしまわないと、{$P$}さんが……。", "zh": "亚利沙姐，要拍多少张啊？差不多该收起来了，不然{$P$}先生会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "69b68e25d23e69b011c9601e8655da75d21ef3591c42d56bbf44bd423d937e34", "ja": "おっ、みんなお疲れさま！　もう揃って……。", "zh": "哦，大家辛苦了！已经都到齐了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fd3fe44695d5492c574a942ddfea538f28d05238b0c475f9b98c6f1892957e37", "ja": "わーっ、{$P$}、ストーップ！\nダメダメ、こっち来ないで！", "zh": "哇——，{$P$}，停——下！\n不行不行，别过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "0ee1091657476998ede0fbe33a613aa5a515783ec9cf893e1c71871eaebbf5c7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n見ちゃダメですって……っと、わわっ！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n都说了不能看啦……哇，哇哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1007_se", "source_sha256": "8e1ecc900deefe2cbf5ea2f88e520d751789223581bc3ea9c0c881834acdae5f", "ja": "どんがらがっしゃーんっ！！", "zh": "咚哐啷哐啷——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6336531de96cd3550622a0c886c23c9570555838c146ce20fe9db8bb5bfc3fd1", "ja": "春香ーっ！？", "zh": "春香——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "42a349f0bd1464e62026aaaf110c49d4ea6d2d7bd1abe29ca940027a4173fbd0", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です！　慣れてますから……えへへ。\n……はっ！？　みんな、今のうちに！", "zh": "没、没关系！我已经习惯了……嘿嘿。\n……啊！？大家，趁现在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "e14a6f89a862425029e2dd029c4da92d8cc4ebb6ca2e36caa353e07095fd00a3", "ja": "はっ！？　志保ちゃん、亜利沙ちゃん、\n早く片付けなきゃ！　そっち持って……行くよ！", "zh": "啊！？志保，亚利沙，得赶紧收拾了！拿着那边的……走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "eb8de533af13cbbde230233b57e0d2907eef2d7081b20adf7100e1a63a4e89f1", "ja": "なるほど……例の、ヒミツだっていうアレか。\n別に無理に見たりはしないぞ。", "zh": "原来如此……就是那个所谓的秘密啊。\n我也不会勉强去看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6f71e20cc468fd7b458c0cf25d24897ece70f5cd24358725e5d8df3dd5795e6f", "ja": "うぅ、ゴメン……なんか焦っちゃって。\n絶対ナイショだよ！　って言われたからさ～。", "zh": "呜呜，抱歉……我刚才有点着急了。\n因为对方跟我说了“绝对要保密哦！”啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "209351a7deb4cd018ae0bb09b23ff8c62cbf605dbd9029753620c3c8f0fe1809", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、\nもう少し気を遣ってくれてもいいとは思いますけど。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也是，\n我觉得您再多用点心也没什么不好就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "567b17345197f392793700cb23b209d9f937138109d62afe0e6df9f148160418", "ja": "それもそうだな……ゴメン。今度から配慮するよ。", "zh": "确实也是……抱歉。下次我会多加注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "e3ee20117166988c189120c0bacd590621bdd2e59cb1ebe71a799669a86cadfd", "ja": "うーん。{$P$}さんに内緒って、\nワクワクしますけど、悪い気もしちゃうなぁ……。", "zh": "嗯——瞒着{$P$}先生，虽然让人觉得很兴奋，可也会忍不住觉得有点过意不去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "0e9f2d313bd144f8bd42d6eeea77a009fd29d3083b4aba063bbd4d403c93a0e0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nちっとも気になったりしないんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你就真的一点都不好奇吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9d61eb56a66325828e0e68600a5cd3ecffc6386c1b21ffbae2855d9bce870a85", "ja": "そりゃ、少しは……いや、だいぶ気にはなるけど。\n楽しみにさせてもらってるからな。", "zh": "那当然，多少还是会在意……不，应该说是相当在意。\n毕竟我可是一直很期待的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "6918222538664071609400727e37f4dadad326f0675aca57ceca5e0ed9e9f814", "ja": "その点はご安心ください！\nありさもビックリの、すごいお宝になってますから。", "zh": "这点请您放心！\n已经成了连亚利沙都会大吃一惊的珍贵宝物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a3a1fa4a26654e3dac7ce66b860e8a62158e7c5316abbe6fd6549b7bbbcdd5f9", "ja": "はは、そうか。それは楽しみだ。\nじゃあとりあえず、ミーティングを始めよう。", "zh": "哈哈，是吗？那可真让人期待。\n那么，先开始开会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "8071b3cc363f88803411ec73cff96e30322a83b7ff7ef8e923835b923c2ed010", "ja": "はいっ！　ええと、私たちは……夕方が\nテーマの『EmotionLight』公演でしたよね。", "zh": "好！那个，我们要做的是……以黄昏为主题的《EmotionLight》公演，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "09ba33cef460f65303523650cce1dcc36be9841abcf276a65d47f4a32f377e9a", "ja": "夕方……テーマとしては、少し難しそうですね。", "zh": "傍晚……作为主题的话，感觉稍微有点难呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "9ba8068df1aadb3e318fbcecc0dd8c8966d3f7cb51f2dae18fc4be77b1c7c353", "ja": "うーん……私たちも、チームなりの目標、\nみたいなものを、考えてみるのはどうかな？", "zh": "嗯……我们是不是也可以试着想想看，制定一个属于我们团队的目标之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "683e05ff017d1e2bb48fc3693528ced14b18dc0c631b8960f35aea28a3235b47", "ja": "いいね！　そういうの大事っぽい。\nえーっと……「ファンへの感謝を表現する」とか！", "zh": "好主意！感觉那种事挺重要的。\n呃——……比如“向粉丝表达感谢”之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "f708e2b7a45a371ba28638ede8656f9d6a4371b6e06070b36a359e1cbc79f298", "ja": "いいね！　他には……ツアーのテーマに合わせて、\n「この時間を大切に！」みたいなのは、どうかな？", "zh": "好主意！还有别的吗……比如配合巡演主题，喊“珍惜此刻！”之类的，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "98d03945b1a061ab20ba372d011b506dd7daba8ec780b1fe9f0c913ccc413529", "ja": "あの……それ、組み合わせられないですかね？\n「今、この時間への感謝」っていう感じで！", "zh": "那个……不能把这两点结合起来吗？\n比如“对此时此刻心怀感激”这种感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "8de3746ac133ef948431f2a1c89d45d0081731959db2fe7c5ea51dc7f5d929ac", "ja": "いいと思います。夕方って、そんな感じで……。\n一日のことを考え直す時間のような気がしますから。", "zh": "我觉得挺好的。黄昏时分，差不多就是那种感觉……\n让人觉得，那是用来重新回想这一天的时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "525ac0ff6cb7ffbf390f560c12512f14787b0b235fadf4053afab80f58302907", "ja": "ここに居ないメンバーにも、\n後で聞いてみるとして……ひとまず、それでOK？", "zh": "就算是不在这里的成员，也等之后再问问她们……先这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "3b5940db3c76c52cd10400ecfcccc4273a17ea5d1c2ddc71abcef9a6d5bacacd", "ja": "そうだね、歩ちゃん。「今、この時間への感謝」……\nいいスローガンになると思うな♪", "zh": "是啊，步。“感谢此刻的时光”……我觉得会是个不错的口号♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "6f1d1baf1402b6d0a9f32e5fd212f1a19be0f2c99685785febcf675077d8e059", "ja": "（ミーティングは、その後もスムーズに進んでいった。\nこれは、安定したチームになりそうだな！）", "zh": "（会议之后也一直进展得很顺利。看来会成为一个稳定的团队啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
